LUMA SUMMARY:
QS 2.1/archive-friction session. Cozmo notes that the 2.1 spec and large writing blocks are confusing Gold’s crude 1.1 transport; a tiny plain-text test is proposed instead. The session is explicitly saved as evidence of Gold’s limitations and the need for 2.1/2.0 redesign.
